  "url": "programming-logic-quiz.html#rq-logical-statements-9",
  "type": "Reading Question",
  "number": "10",
  "title": "",
  "body": "  In MATLAB, A & B | C is evaluated as A & (B | C) .    False. AND has higher precedence than OR, so it is evaluated as (A & B) | C .   "
