  "body": " Accumulating a Sum   A common loop pattern is accumulation : start with an initial value, then repeatedly update it. Also known as a running sum . Here we compute the sum :    totalSum = 0; % initialize for i = 1:5 totalSum = totalSum + i; end fprintf('Total Sum: %i\\n', totalSum)    Here, totalSum starts at 0, then increases by 1, then 2, and so on, reaching 15.    Expanded loop for the accumulation of totalSum ⤵︎  totalSum = 0; i = 1; totalSum = totalSum + i; % = 0 + 1 = 1; i = 2; totalSum = totalSum + i; % = 1 + 2 = 3; i = 3; totalSum = totalSum + i; % = 3 + 3 = 6; i = 4; totalSum = totalSum + i; % = 6 + 4 = 10; i = 5; totalSum = totalSum + i; % = 10 + 5 = 15;     "
